    # "What a lovely day for a date 💙"
    "今天真是个约会的好日子💙"

# game/script.rpy:1791
translate zh ch4_1b84dc6c:

    # "We walk side by side, Pastille with his hands stuffed into oversized pockets. So cute..."
    "我们并肩行走，帕斯提尔的双手塞进宽大的衣服口袋里。真可爱……"

# game/script.rpy:1792
translate zh ch4_2b607e30:

    # "He's in the perfect position to be clinged to~ But, I must refrain."
    "他这个姿势很适合被我挽手臂~但我必须忍住。"

# game/script.rpy:1793
translate zh ch4_6a692108:

    # "I doubt he'd be comfortable with me hanging all over him in broad daylight. Besides, there's no need to jump into such overt affections just yet."
    "现在这大白天的，我要是这么弄他，他估计会不舒服。再说了，现在还没到打直球的时候。"

# game/script.rpy:1794
translate zh ch4_76b2fe88_2:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:1801
translate zh ch4_b6217edd:

    # "When we reach the café, Pastille orders us some doughnuts to share."
    "到达咖啡馆后，帕斯提尔给我们这桌点了些甜甜圈。"

# game/script.rpy:1802
translate zh ch4_f8a53225:

    # "I wonder what else he has planned...?"
    "不知道他还计划了什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:1803
translate zh ch4_d90128ed:

    # "He only mentioned hanging out--who knows what that could entail~?"
    "他只提到要出去玩——谁知道那还意味着什么~？"

# game/script.rpy:1804
translate zh ch4_98bb6b9f:

    # "Munching away at our breakfast, I study his face for clues..."
    "我一边啃早餐，一边研究他的表情……"

# game/script.rpy:1805
translate zh ch4_76b2fe88_3:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:1807
translate zh ch4_4e7d5c55:

    # "He really is so cute."
    "他真的很可爱。"

# game/script.rpy:1808
translate zh ch4_adc44e53:

    # "I remember the choker. He wore it on our first date as well 💙"
    "我记得那个项圈，他在我们第一次约会时也戴了💙"

# game/script.rpy:1810
translate zh ch4_1e8c7e1f:

    # "And that's the same barrette he left behind after one of our sleepovers~ Such pointed choice in accessories..."
    "那个发夹和他在某次来我这过夜后留下的是同一个~他戴的配饰总是很亮眼……"

# game/script.rpy:1812
translate zh ch4_1fd546cf:

    # "Ah, and now all my staring has embarrassed him. You're too easily flustered, my sweet 💙"
    "啊，现在我盯得他不好意思起来了。你太容易被调戏了，我的甜心💙"

# game/script.rpy:1813
translate zh ch4_0f78683c:

    # nvl clear
    # w date "Forgive me for staring; I was trying to intuit what you might have planned for us after this."
    nvl clear
    w date "抱歉这么盯着你。我在琢磨吃完早餐后你还计划了什么。"

# game/script.rpy:1815
translate zh ch4_bbf68c72:

    # p ehe "Oh, um, nothing in particular... wandering around town is enough for me."
    p ehe "噢，呃，没什么特别的……对我来说在镇子里随便逛逛就够好了。"

# game/script.rpy:1816
translate zh ch4_0455f80a:

    # w calm "I see 💙 Loitering does facilitate conversation quite well."
    w calm "明白了💙闲逛确实有利于交谈。"

# game/script.rpy:1817
translate zh ch4_39f199d8:

    # p shy "As long as we're out and about, we won't end up... um...."
    p shy "只要我们出门在外，最后就不会……呃……"

# game/script.rpy:1818
translate zh ch4_db519a24:

    # w my "(Oh, is he going to say it~?)"
    w my "（噢，他会说出来吗~？）"

# game/script.rpy:1819
translate zh ch4_ae3f626a:

    # p omg "Y-you know...."
    p omg "你、你知道的……"

# game/script.rpy:1820
translate zh ch4_143046d9:

    # w innocent "(Hmhm, of course not 💙)"
    w innocent "（哼嗯，当然不会💙）"

# game/script.rpy:1821
translate zh ch4_98697be5:

    # p wha "I actually like when we get to talk...!"
    p wha "我其实很喜欢和你聊天……！"

# game/script.rpy:1822
translate zh ch4_09628e53:

    # p uhoh "I-I mean, not that we DON'T when I sleep over, it's just... a different kind...."
    p uhoh "我、我的意思是，不是说我来过夜的时候我们没有聊，只是……两者不同……"

# game/script.rpy:1823
translate zh ch4_c6264bf7:

    # w calm "True... 💙"
    w calm "当然……💙"

# game/script.rpy:1824
translate zh ch4_b63fac77:

    # p flustered2 "Sorry... now I feel like I'm talking too much."
    p flustered2 "对不起……我现在感觉自己有点话太多了。"

# game/script.rpy:1825
translate zh ch4_b1f80a86:

    # w love "Not at all, my sweet! I have to say, I rather enjoy our chats as well~"
    w love "完全没有，甜心！我必须承认，我也喜欢咱俩能聊天的时候~"

# game/script.rpy:1826
translate zh ch4_062a8003:

    # w teehee "Even if you can't resist cutting them short once we're behind closed doors 💙"
    w teehee "虽说一到私底下，你就会忍不住提前打住聊天环节💙"

# game/script.rpy:1827
translate zh ch4_8ad9efbe:

    # p omgstop "I-I'm really sorry...!" with vpunch
    p omgstop "我、我很抱歉……！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:1829
translate zh ch4_7f6c0c2e:

    # "He's simply too much fun..."
    "他实在太有意思了……"

# game/script.rpy:1830
translate zh ch4_a556fc99:

    # "Ah, but this is no time for my usual teasing~! I can't forget what brought us here..."
    "啊，但现在不是调戏他的时候~！我不能忘了我们来这的原因……"

# game/script.rpy:1832
translate zh ch4_23b094b1:

    # "This is the perfect opportunity to become more deeply acquainted."
    "现在正是与他深交的最好时机。"

# game/script.rpy:1833
translate zh ch4_d08bb998:

    # "I'll learn all about Pastille, so that I don't end up crossing the line again..."
    "我会全面了解帕斯提尔，这样我就不会再次越线了……"

# game/script.rpy:1834
translate zh ch4_76b2fe88_4:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:1837
translate zh ch4_631bf0aa:

    # w oh "In the interest of defining boundaries... are there any subjects I should avoid bringing up with you?"
    w oh "既然是要说清界限……有什么是我需要避免跟你提的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1838
translate zh ch4_0d8de333:

    # w guilty "On that note, has there ever been anything I've said that's caused you discomfort in the slightest? Please don't hold back."
    w guilty "就是说，在我之前说过的话里，有没有让你感到哪怕一丁点不舒服的部分？请尽管告诉我。"

# game/script.rpy:1839
translate zh ch4_84306ef7:

    # p think "Hmm... nothing really comes to mind...."
    p think "嗯……我还真想不到什么……"

# game/script.rpy:1840
translate zh ch4_a73c1ed9:

    # p shy "I mean, I've always felt... pretty comfortable around you... so we could probably talk about anything and it'd be okay."
    p shy "我的意思是，我一直觉得和你相处起来……挺舒服的……所以我们应该聊任何事都是可以的。"

# game/script.rpy:1841
translate zh ch4_15ab8bed:

    # w love "Anything, really? Surely you must have SOME sensitive topics you'd like to avoid."
    w love "任何事，真的吗？你肯定还是有些想要避免的敏感话题吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1842
translate zh ch4_7af929e3:

    # p oh "I guess so... but I wouldn't really be worried talking about them with you."
    p oh "我猜是吧……但如果是和你聊，我就不会担心。"

# game/script.rpy:1843
translate zh ch4_d4971bd3:

    # p ehe "Actually, you might be the most attentive person I've ever met. Maybe that's why I'm not worried at all."
    p ehe "说真的，你可能是我见过的所有人里最周到细心的那一个了。可能这就是为什么我完全不会有任何顾虑吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1844
translate zh ch4_5e290654:

    # w innocent "Hmhm, I'm glad to hear that 💙"
    w innocent "哼嗯，我很高兴听到你这么说💙"

# game/script.rpy:1845
translate zh ch4_3e0eb085:

    # w smile "But you've certainly piqued my curiosity... what kinds of sensitive topics, if you don't mind me asking?"
    w smile "但你实在点燃了我的好奇心……是什么样的敏感话题呢，你不介意我问的话？"

# game/script.rpy:1846
translate zh ch4_55849c5e:

    # p think "Like... for example. You've never made me feel weird about gender stuff."
    p think "比如……举个例子。你从来不会让我在性别问题上感到不自在。"

# game/script.rpy:1847
translate zh ch4_7baf213c:

    # w oh "I'd certainly hope not! That one's a bit sensitive for me as well."
    w oh "我自然希望不会！这个话题对我来说也有些微妙。"

# game/script.rpy:1848
translate zh ch4_6486f9c9:

    # p happy "See? That's why it feels okay to talk about with you."
    p happy "对吧？这就是为什么和你谈论这个话题就感觉没什么。"

# game/script.rpy:1849
translate zh ch4_6927813d:

    # p shy "I'm, well... not very masculine. So I get mistaken for a girl every now and then..."
    p shy "我，呃……不是很有男子气概。所以我有时会被认错成女孩子……"

# game/script.rpy:1850
translate zh ch4_0f2dfa36:

    # p oh "Not that it's something I get mad about or anything. I've always dealt with it, ever since I was little."
    p oh "倒不是我会因为这种事暴走什么的。我从很小的时候就开始学着面对这种情况了。"

# game/script.rpy:1852
translate zh ch4_be78c7ec:

    # p flustered2 "Still, I think it bothers me in particular, since... well, you know, I'm intersex."
    p flustered2 "但它还是会使我尤为困扰，因为……呃，毕竟，我是个双性人。"

# game/script.rpy:1853
translate zh ch4_6f967fdb:

    # w decline "Mm, right."
    w decline "唔，也是。"

# game/script.rpy:1854
translate zh ch4_136e9d0e:

    # p ohno2 "I want to be recognized as a boy. But I like wearing feminine clothes, too..."
    p ohno2 "我想被当作男生看待。但同时我也喜欢穿女性化的衣服……"

# game/script.rpy:1855
translate zh ch4_b2e10257:

    # w happy "Yes, that's it exactly! I feel the very same!"
    w happy "没错，正是这样！我完全感同身受！"

# game/script.rpy:1856
translate zh ch4_e80b7732:

    # p ehe "Right? Like, I don't wanna be limited to presenting only one way... even if I'm fine with boyish clothes, too."
    p ehe "对吧？就是，我不想被限制成只能展现一种样子……即使我其实穿男性化的衣服也无所谓。"

# game/script.rpy:1857
translate zh ch4_8ba96462:

    # w calm "For me, it's simply about looking beautiful. I dress to fit my ideal."
    w calm "对我来说，我只是想打扮得足够漂亮。我的穿着是为了符合我的心中所想。"

# game/script.rpy:1858
translate zh ch4_ad75be97:

    # w oh "It's not a matter of gender, but aesthetic preference. These are the clothes I feel best in."
    w oh "这与性别无关，只是一种审美偏好。这些衣服我穿着感觉最好。"

# game/script.rpy:1859
translate zh ch4_fc9182ac:

    # p embarrassed "You, um... look really good in them, too...."
    p embarrassed "而且，呃……你这样穿真的很好看……"

# game/script.rpy:1860
translate zh ch4_f6672aa7:

    # w innocent "Why, thank you! And I must say, YOUR sense of style never fails to impress 💙"
    w innocent "噢，谢谢你！而我必须承认，你的穿衣风格总是令人眼前一亮💙"

# game/script.rpy:1861
translate zh ch4_e09db7a3:

    # p omg "Ah, haha... I'm glad you like it...."
    p omg "啊，哈哈……你能喜欢我很开心……"

# game/script.rpy:1863
translate zh ch4_403c728d:

    # n "Pastille sips his drink while Periwinkle continues."
    n "帕斯提尔抿着饮料，佩兰温可继续说道。"

# game/script.rpy:1865
translate zh ch4_6a1d304f:

    # w calm "When I was young... I didn't have the confidence to dress so beautifully. Hmhm, can you even imagine it?"
    w calm "我小时候……没有穿得这么漂亮的信心。哼哼，你能想象吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1866
translate zh ch4_40871af5:

    # p ehe "You, without confidence? No, I'm not sure that's possible."
    p ehe "你，没有信心？不可能吧，我很难相信。"

# game/script.rpy:1867
translate zh ch4_3ddf3ee7:

    # w happy "Right~? I suppose I was a different person back then."
    w happy "对吧~？我那时候可能根本是另一个人吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1868
translate zh ch4_58aae749:

    # w neutral "Where I grew up... things were much more black and white. You were either a boy or a girl, and you HAD to dress accordingly."
    w neutral "在我的故乡……很多事都是非黑即白的。你要么是男生，要么是女生，而且你必须根据这点打扮自己。"

# game/script.rpy:1869
translate zh ch4_51a7c612:

    # p ohno2 "Ah, that sounds harsh..."
    p ohno2 "啊，听起来很残酷……"

# game/script.rpy:1870
translate zh ch4_c463434f:

    # w my "It very much was! I was completely MISERABLE!"
    w my "就是很残酷！我那时候超级痛苦！"

# game/script.rpy:1871
translate zh ch4_424e83ef:

    # w oh "Perhaps it's because I come from that sort of environment... that I want it to be known, I look this glamorous as a BOY."
    w oh "可能就是因为我来自于那样的环境……所以我想让所有人都知道，我是作为一个男生打扮得如此夺目的。"

# game/script.rpy:1872
translate zh ch4_9d701ab1:

    # w pout "Not to say that this is easy for ANY gender--I only wish for my efforts to be acknowledged!"
    w pout "这当然对任何性别来说都不容易——我只希望我的努力能被承认！"

# game/script.rpy:1873
translate zh ch4_180fe63a:

    # p shy "Haha, I think that's just your competitive spirit again."
    p shy "哈哈，我想那只是你的好胜心又作祟了。"

# game/script.rpy:1874
translate zh ch4_564ec052:

    # w happy "See, you truly understand me~!"
    w happy "看吧，你真的很懂我~！"

# game/script.rpy:1876
translate zh ch4_50f5fa7a:

    # n "They laugh together. Periwinkle relaxes into his chair and finishes his drink with a big smile on his face..."
    n "他们一同大笑。佩兰温可放松地陷进椅子里，喝完饮料时脸上挂着灿烂的笑容……"

# game/script.rpy:1880
translate zh ch4_ab260034:

    # "Pastille and I depart from the café and make our way down the street."
    "帕斯提尔和我离开了咖啡馆，走在大街上。"

# game/script.rpy:1881
translate zh ch4_3d888206:

    # "With no destination in mind, the details of our surroundings--things I've never really paid any mind to, make themselves known."
    "我们没有目的地，于是周遭那些我从未仔细留意过的细枝末节都变得清晰可闻。"

# game/script.rpy:1882
translate zh ch4_00e39214:

    # "Aromas from the bakery, the flower shop, the patisserie; each distinct and enticing. I'm left with a peaceful feeling as we pass each of them by."
    "面包店、花店、糕点店里飘来的香气，每种都独特而诱人。我在路过门店时感到了宁静。"

# game/script.rpy:1883
translate zh ch4_01ac64e9:

    # nvl clear
    # "Now there's a fun idea... a scent that transforms over time, giving you a sense of place--"
    nvl clear
    "我有个有趣的想法……随时间变化的香气，给人一种场所感——"

# game/script.rpy:1885
translate zh ch4_5e60bbe1:

    # "Ah, but I shouldn't be thinking about work while I'm on a date~!"
    "啊，但我不该在约会的时候想工作上的事情~！"

# game/script.rpy:1886
translate zh ch4_6b51ed02:

    # "I turn my attention back to Pastille."
    "我重新把注意力转到帕斯提尔身上。"

# game/script.rpy:1887
translate zh ch4_76b2fe88_5:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:1890
translate zh ch4_d421c7da:

    # w date smile "With gender thoroughly discussed, the next personal question would have to be..."
    w date smile "性别话题彻底讨论完了，那么下一个私人话题是……"

# game/script.rpy:1891
translate zh ch4_83f1994a:

    # w happy "Ooh, sexuality! Which type of partner gets you THE MOST hot and bothered~?"
    w happy "噢噢，性取向！哪种伴侣让你最性奋、最在意~？"

# game/script.rpy:1892
translate zh ch4_4c24ed9b:

    # p omgstop "SHH...! You can't just shout those words in the middle of a crowd...!!" with vpunch
    p omgstop "嘘……！这种话怎么能在大庭广众之下喊出来……！！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:1893
translate zh ch4_747240e4:

    # w calm "Ohh, who's even listening? I certainly wasn't shouting."
    w calm "哦，哪有人听？我可没喊。"

# game/script.rpy:1894
translate zh ch4_7e39cd48:

    # p flustered "Please don't talk about that stuff too loudly... people will start giving us weird looks...!"
    p flustered "拜托别太大声讨论这种话题……其他人会投来异样的目光……！"

# game/script.rpy:1895
translate zh ch4_4e9876f6:

    # w love "Shall I whisper it into your ear, then~?"
    w love "那么，我应该在你的耳边低声说吗~？"

# game/script.rpy:1896
translate zh ch4_67ef6f9e:

    # p scream "TH-THAT'S EVEN WORSE...!" with vpunch
    p scream "那、那更糟糕了啊……！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:1897
translate zh ch4_49c373ff:

    # w pout "Hmph, NOW who's shouting."
    w pout "哼，现在是谁在喊呢。"

# game/script.rpy:1900
translate zh ch4_33263a1e:

    # n "Pastille glances around, but despite his outburst, Periwinkle was right--no one had turned their way."
    n "帕斯提尔环顾四周。虽然他刚才吼了一嗓子，但佩兰温可说得没错——没人转头看他们。"

# game/script.rpy:1902
translate zh ch4_9af32e30:

    # p ehe2 "Sorry... I-I guess it's okay...."
    p ehe2 "对不起……我、我猜讨论这个话题也无妨……"

# game/script.rpy:1903
translate zh ch4_85f11e29:

    # w innocent "Feel free to stop me if I'm being too much, yes?"
    w innocent "如果我太过了，就尽管让我打住，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1904
translate zh ch4_e44221b2:

    # p uhoh "There's nothing wrong with being a LITTLE too much...."
    p uhoh "有一点点过倒是可以啦……"

# game/script.rpy:1905
translate zh ch4_0f1fc0c3:

    # w calm "Hmhm, I imagined you'd say so. Returning to the topic at hand..."
    w calm "哼嗯，我猜到了你会这么说。回到这个话题……"

# game/script.rpy:1906
translate zh ch4_cd6834d6:

    # w happy "I've been with all sorts of partners. I'd say I can appreciate just about anyone 💙"
    w happy "各种伴侣我都谈过。我觉得任何人我都能欣赏💙"

# game/script.rpy:1907
translate zh ch4_3827f8fd:

    # w shy "But I must admit, I prefer witch boys above all others..."
    w shy "但我必须承认，我最喜欢的还是巫师男孩……"

# game/script.rpy:1908
translate zh ch4_4751efb0:

    # p wow "I-I would also... say... witch boys...."
    p wow "我、我最喜欢的……也是……巫师男孩……"

# game/script.rpy:1909
translate zh ch4_a4186c37:

    # w drool "OH~~~? Care to elaborate, my sweet?"
    w drool "哦~~~？要不要展开说说，我的甜心？"

# game/script.rpy:1910
translate zh ch4_859906e5:

    # p omg "Nope...! That's... all I have to say on the matter...." with vpunch
    p omg "不要……！那……就是我能说的全部了……" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:1911
translate zh ch4_2c430f31:

    # w teehee "Hmhm, I'll have to tease it out of you later, then~ 💙"
    w teehee "哼哼，看来我只能待会儿想办法从你嘴里敲出来了~💙"

# game/script.rpy:1912
translate zh ch4_3d8c6825:

    # p dying "(AAAAHH...!!!)"
    p dying "（啊啊啊……！！！）"

# game/script.rpy:1915
translate zh ch4_462c84e0:

    # "We follow along the twisting streets of the shopping district, looking in each of the windows as we pass them by."
    "我们走在商业区盘根错节的街道上，路过橱窗就朝里面看看。"

# game/script.rpy:1916
translate zh ch4_f823e801:

    # "This is my favorite part of town--filled with all the high-end boutiques you could dream of 💙"
    "这是我在市区最喜欢的地方，你能想象到的任何高档时装店这里都有💙"

# game/script.rpy:1917
translate zh ch4_9c01e828:

    # "The mannequins from one of them catch my eye, and I lightly grab Pastille's sleeve to draw his attention."
    "一家时装店里的人形模特吸引了我的目光，我轻拽帕斯提尔的袖子引起他的注意。"

# game/script.rpy:1918
translate zh ch4_76b2fe88_6:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:1922
translate zh ch4_232f4575:

    # w date "You'd look so good in that, don't you think?"
    w date "你穿那个会很好看，不觉得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1923
translate zh ch4_4d24cc6c:

    # p shy "Really? I don't know if something so extravagant would really suit me..."
    p shy "真的吗？我不确定这么浮夸的衣服适不适合我……"

# game/script.rpy:1924
translate zh ch4_16ac6632:

    # w happy "Nonsense, you could pull it off~! The accents match your eyes 💙"
    w happy "胡说，你完全镇得住这套衣服~！那些点缀和你的眼睛很配💙"

# game/script.rpy:1925
translate zh ch4_2006a486:

    # p ehe "Eheh, I guess they do..."
    p ehe "诶嘿，我想是吧……"

# game/script.rpy:1926
translate zh ch4_b01a9be6:

    # w oh "Hmm, but you'd look great in that one, too... oh, and THAT one...!"
    w oh "唔，但你穿那个也会很好看……哦，还有那个……！"

# game/script.rpy:1927
translate zh ch4_5204e835:

    # p embarrassed "Y-you're pointing to everything...."
    p embarrassed "你、你每件衣服都指……"

# game/script.rpy:1928
translate zh ch4_9ad57405:

    # w shy "Yes, well, the alternative would be to say that I'd like to see you in nothing at all 💙"
    w shy "没错，不过也可以说是我想看你什么都不穿💙"

# game/script.rpy:1929
translate zh ch4_a9e27c65:

    # p omg "A-AH...." with vpunch
    p omg "啊、啊……" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:1931
translate zh ch4_21b7c10a:

    # w smile "Do you go clothes shopping often? You have such a variety of cute looks."
    w smile "你经常买衣服吗？你有那么多种可爱的打扮。"

# game/script.rpy:1932
translate zh ch4_a98d72c6:

    # p shy "Oh, um, every now and then... but I can't afford the kinds of stuff they sell here."
    p shy "噢，呃，偶尔吧……但这里的东西我买不起。"

# game/script.rpy:1933
translate zh ch4_21f87c1a:

    # w oh "It IS rather pricy... but the brands are worth it."
    w oh "确实比较贵……但它们的品牌使它们物有所值。"

# game/script.rpy:1934
translate zh ch4_e26fc98b:

    # p ehe "I really don't know anything about fashion. I just end up picking whatever stands out to me...."
    p ehe "我真的对时尚一窍不通。我都是哪件看得顺眼买哪件……"

# game/script.rpy:1935
translate zh ch4_06e4ae9b:

    # w smile "As it should be! You're better off not becoming obsessed with these things--it certainly isn't easy on the wallet."
    w smile "本就该这样！你最好不要对这些东西太着迷——那对钱包不好。"

# game/script.rpy:1936
translate zh ch4_4dc60c1a:

    # p smile "I'll leave the brand-name stuff to you, then. Just seeing them is enough for me."
    p smile "那挑品牌名什么的你来就好了。那些衣服我看看就行了。"

# game/script.rpy:1937
translate zh ch4_1715bc7d:

    # w teehee "Oh, just seeing them? Not stripping them off of me? 💙"
    w teehee "哦，就看看？不是把它们从我身上扯下来？💙"

# game/script.rpy:1938
translate zh ch4_7c54d0a0:

    # p dying "AAAAAHH...!!" with vpunch
    p dying "啊啊啊啊……！！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:1941
translate zh ch4_6d3eceb8:

    # "After our little fashion circuit, we end up near the café where we'd started."
    "在时装区逛了一圈后，我们又来到了之前那个咖啡馆旁边。"

# game/script.rpy:1942
translate zh ch4_ffdc441f:

    # "I've certainly worked him up enough to take home right away, but..."
    "现在直接带他回家也水到渠成了，但是……"

# game/script.rpy:1943
translate zh ch4_2c40055e:

    # "That would mean cutting our date short! And what a shame that would be 💙"
    "那就意味着要提前结束我们的约会！那样多可惜呀💙"

# game/script.rpy:1944
translate zh ch4_c2d04cee:

    # "I skip ahead of Pastille and twirl around to face him."
    "我轻快地跳到帕斯提尔面前，转身面对他。"

# game/script.rpy:1945
translate zh ch4_76b2fe88_7:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:1948
translate zh ch4_5061977c:

    # w date innocent "There's somewhere I'd like to take you!"
    w date innocent "我想带你去个地方！"

# game/script.rpy:1949
translate zh ch4_8f04b75d:

    # p um "Huh? Sure..."
    p um "嗯？好……"

# game/script.rpy:1950
translate zh ch4_4a86880b:

    # w smile "I realize I've seen YOUR workplace, but you haven't seen mine. It's a little apothecary I sell my magic to for distribution."
    w smile "我发现我已经见过了你的工作地点，而你还没见过我的。那是一间小药房，我会把魔法卖到那里，供其销售。"

# game/script.rpy:1951
translate zh ch4_4e3c1a91:

    # p oh "An apothecary? I thought you sold perfumes...?"
    p oh "药房？我还以为你卖的是香水……？"

# game/script.rpy:1952
translate zh ch4_7845214f:

    # w calm "Technically, that's all they are. I don't claim they deliver any lasting health benefits..."
    w calm "严格来说，那里卖的就是香水。我不会说它们能给健康带来什么永久益处……"

# game/script.rpy:1953
translate zh ch4_3283e0de:

    # w smile "They're more for healing the mind. Anxiety, stress, and any other unpleasant feelings can be lifted away with just the right aromas~"
    w smile "它们主要用来治疗心灵。焦虑、压力，任何不愉快的情绪都可以用合适的香气来驱散~"

# game/script.rpy:1954
translate zh ch4_99916f10:

    # w oh "It's more effective for some than others. But for those sensitive to such things, it can make quite the difference."
    w oh "个中效果因人而异。对那些对香气敏感的人来说，效果就还挺明显的。"

# game/script.rpy:1955
translate zh ch4_b1864f45:

    # p think "Huh...."
    p think "唔……"

# game/script.rpy:1956
translate zh ch4_7f7e2939:

    # w guilty "And now I fear I've bored you with all this uninteresting work chatter..."
    w guilty "你是不是被我唠叨这些没意思的工作事务搞得无聊了……"

# game/script.rpy:1957
translate zh ch4_bb924acc:

    # p wha "N-no! That's not it at all--I was just thinking..."
    p wha "不、不会！完全没有——我只是在想……"

# game/script.rpy:1958
translate zh ch4_3efb722b:

    # p shy "It's really admirable, that your magic can be used to help people like that...."
    p shy "这真的很令人钦佩——你的魔法可以这样帮助到大家……"

# game/script.rpy:1959
translate zh ch4_cd5ea0a1:

    # w ah "(Admirable...?)"
    w ah "（令人钦佩……？）"

# game/script.rpy:1960
translate zh ch4_5eb41425:

    # p ehe "Selling candy... I think, makes people happy too. Maybe that's what's fun about it."
    p ehe "卖糖果……也能让人们开心吧。也许这就是干这行的乐趣所在。"

# game/script.rpy:1961
translate zh ch4_a605b20b:

    # p shy "Not that I'd ever claim our candy is healthy either. If anything, you might get cavities..."
    p shy "我倒不会说我们的糖果就益于健康啦。反而有可能让人长蛀牙……"

# game/script.rpy:1962
translate zh ch4_0ed90fce:

    # w happy "Hmhm, the witch who owns the apothecary really liked the sample I passed along to her."
    w happy "哼哼，那间药房的巫师主人很喜欢我给她的小样。"

# game/script.rpy:1963
translate zh ch4_33647d12:

    # w teehee "Perhaps she'll ask to distrubute your candies as well~!"
    w teehee "也许她也会想分销你们的糖果~！"

# game/script.rpy:1964
translate zh ch4_5b3353f1:

    # p flustered2 "Sy--um, my boss would never agree to that."
    p flustered2 "小希——呃，我老板绝对不会同意的。"

# game/script.rpy:1965
translate zh ch4_3c241263:

    # p smile "Anyway... I'd be happy to see it. Lead the way!"
    p smile "不过……我还是很乐意去看看。带路吧！"

# game/script.rpy:1966
translate zh ch4_573a6eaf:

    # w innocent "Very well 💙 Follow me~"
    w innocent "很好💙跟我来~"

# game/script.rpy:1974
translate zh ch4_d2942b5c:

    # "When we enter the apothecary, it looks to be completely empty."
    "我们到达药房的时候，里面看上去空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:1975
translate zh ch4_6c59545b:

    # "Astragalus usually sits in the back room, consumed in her work, until she hears the chime of a customer entering."
    "艾丝特格拉斯一般都坐在后屋里潜心工作，除非听到客人进门的铃声。"

# game/script.rpy:1976
translate zh ch4_5aa40d36:

    # "If you ask me, she could really use another helper to liven up the place..."
    "要我说，她真应该找个帮手让这里热闹起来……"

# game/script.rpy:1977
translate zh ch4_d6fdead9:

    # "But I suppose the hustle and bustle of an ever-busy shop would have its own setbacks."
    "但我想，一个一直忙碌的店子带来的喧嚣熙攘肯定也有它不好的地方吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1978
translate zh ch4_76b2fe88_8:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:1981
translate zh ch4_2c0acbc5:

    # w date "Feel free to look around. I'm going to go and greet the owner 💙"
    w date "尽管四处看看。我去和店主人打个招呼💙"

# game/script.rpy:1982
translate zh ch4_edde0847:

    # p smile "Sure."
    p smile "好。"

# game/script.rpy:1987
translate zh ch4_03389dda:

    # n "Periwinkle leans over the counter to peek into the back room."
    n "佩兰温可趴在柜台上朝后屋里瞄。"

# game/script.rpy:1989
translate zh ch4_b6b8917e:

    # w date happy "Astragalus~! You have a customer~~!"
    w date happy "艾丝特格拉斯~！你有客人了~~！"

# game/script.rpy:1992
translate zh ch4_17a4c616:

    # a "Oh, Periwinkle. Didn't expect to see you back so soon."
    a "喔，佩兰温可。没想到这么快又见到你。"

# game/script.rpy:1993
translate zh ch4_8bd3c979:

    # w innocent "I brought Pastille! We're on a date 💙"
    w innocent "我把帕斯提尔带来了！我们在约会💙"

# game/script.rpy:1994
translate zh ch4_95b073e2:

    # a annoyed "...Okay."
    a annoyed "……哦。"

# game/script.rpy:1995
translate zh ch4_b2245627:

    # n "She looks over at Pastille, who waves when he notices he's being watched. Astragalus turns back to Periwinkle."
    n "她朝帕斯提尔看过去，后者注意到这道目光后朝她挥了挥手。艾丝特格拉斯重新面向佩兰温可。"

# game/script.rpy:1996
translate zh ch4_215220bc:

    # a whatever "I take it you decided NOT to heed my advice."
    a whatever "看来你没打算听取我的建议。"

# game/script.rpy:1997
translate zh ch4_b3e20422:

    # w my "Hm? What advice?"
    w my "嗯？什么建议？"

# game/script.rpy:1998
translate zh ch4_e1925ef2:

    # a augh "Why bother coming to me if you're just gonna do whatever you want..."
    a augh "既然你都打算随心所欲了，干吗还来找我……"

# game/script.rpy:1999
translate zh ch4_42d8b424:

    # a closed "Well, whatever. Is there a reason you're here?"
    a closed "算了，随便吧。你来这里的原因是？"

# game/script.rpy:2000
translate zh ch4_cd2145bd:

    # w innocent "I thought I'd drop by to give you a little update! As you can see, everything is fine now."
    w innocent "我想来让你知道最新进展！你也看到了，现在一切如常。"

# game/script.rpy:2001
translate zh ch4_ac82b301:

    # a eyeroll "...Sure. Very normal of you to suddenly bring one of your dates here."
    a eyeroll "……当然了。突然带约会对象来店里，多么正常。"

# game/script.rpy:2002
translate zh ch4_d2135757:

    # w my "Is it not? I visit you all the time!"
    w my "难道不是吗？我经常来店里啊！"

# game/script.rpy:2003
translate zh ch4_59449ce5:

    # a lol "Yeah, not for stuff like this."
    a lol "是啊，但从前来意不同。"

# game/script.rpy:2004
translate zh ch4_bfc9f6c6:

    # w happy "Anyway--I wanted you to meet Pastille!"
    w happy "总之——我想让你见见帕斯提尔！"

# game/script.rpy:2005
translate zh ch4_479d8d54:

    # w "Pastille~! Come over here 💙"
    w "帕斯提尔~！过来这边💙"

# game/script.rpy:2007
translate zh ch4_347c886b:

    # n "Startled by suddenly being called upon, Pastille fumbles the bottle he was holding and it crashes onto the floor."
    n "帕斯提尔因为突然被喊给吓了一跳，他手中的瓶子一不小心砰的一声摔到了地上。"

# game/script.rpy:2009
translate zh ch4_a645f843:

    # w ohdear "Ah--"
    w ohdear "啊——"

# game/script.rpy:2010
translate zh ch4_da2d5595:

    # a augh "HEY, you break it, you buy it!" with vpunch
    a augh "喂，弄坏了就得买！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:2011
translate zh ch4_182e1ea6:

    # p "Sorry!! I-I can fix it--"
    p "对不起！！我、我可以修好——"

# game/script.rpy:2013
translate zh ch4_96d34e8e:

    # n "Pastille sweeps the pieces of the bottle into a pile along with its powdered contents."
    n "帕斯提尔把瓶子碎片和里面的粉末扫到一起。"

# game/script.rpy:2015
translate zh ch4_4e1d7957:

    # n "He holds his hands over the pile, now glowing with magic, and the three of them watch as it reassembles perfectly before them."
    n "他把手盖在上面，他的双手散发着魔法的光芒，然后那个瓶子在他们三人的眼皮子底下重新组合起来，恢复如初了。"

# game/script.rpy:2016
translate zh ch4_0b2deec4:

    # w ah "(Impressive... He's done it so quickly....)"
    w ah "（真厉害……这么快……）"

# game/script.rpy:2019
translate zh ch4_4b28fdb7:

    # p ehe2 "There... good as new."
    p ehe2 "好了……完好如初。"

# game/script.rpy:2020
translate zh ch4_0508b2ea:

    # a whatever "...Bring it here."
    a whatever "……拿过来。"

# game/script.rpy:2021
translate zh ch4_4fd60af9:

    # p um "Ah--um... sure. S-sorry...."
    p um "啊——呃……当然了。对、对不起……"

# game/script.rpy:2022
translate zh ch4_62c15c89:

    # w guilty "(I can't help but feel I've put Pastille in yet another uncomfortable situation....)"
    w guilty "（我不禁感到自己又把帕斯提尔置于了不适的处境……）"

# game/script.rpy:2023
translate zh ch4_2664336a:

    # a hm "...Damn, can't even tell it was ever busted up. This kind of magic your specialty?"
    a hm "……见鬼，我都看不出来它摔碎过。这种魔法是你的招牌？"

# game/script.rpy:2024
translate zh ch4_0b008a8e:

    # p ehe "Not really... I only learned it because I thought it'd come in handy."
    p ehe "没有啦……我学这个只是因为觉得它能派上用场。"

# game/script.rpy:2025
translate zh ch4_c184027e:

    # a closed "Huh."
    a closed "哈。"

# game/script.rpy:2029
translate zh ch4_33a20748:

    # n "Astragalus continues inspecting the bottle, and then takes it into the back room without saying another word."
    n "艾丝特格拉斯继续审视着那个瓶子，她把它拿进后屋，什么也没说了。"

# game/script.rpy:2030
translate zh ch4_e17b00b3:

    # w date my "(Wow~ I suppose she was impressed, too!)"
    w date my "（哇~看来她也被惊到了！）"

# game/script.rpy:2033
translate zh ch4_f3676b3b:

    # p "Is she mad at me...? I can't really tell...."
    p "她生我气了吗……？我看不出来……"

# game/script.rpy:2034
translate zh ch4_a65c95b5:

    # w happy "It looks like you were spared today 💙 That spell really saved you."
    w happy "看来你今天逃过一劫💙那个法术救了你。"

# game/script.rpy:2035
translate zh ch4_f977739a:

    # p flustered2 "I can't believe I did that... I'm not usually this clumsy, I swear."
    p flustered2 "难以相信我竟然把瓶子摔了……我平常没这么笨手笨脚的，我发誓。"

# game/script.rpy:2036
translate zh ch4_ebece81c:

    # w love "Oh, but wouldn't it be adorable if you were? Pastille the klutz~! 💙"
    w love "噢，但如果你有的话，那不是很可爱？笨木头帕斯提尔~！💙"

# game/script.rpy:2037
translate zh ch4_b4268f28:

    # p scream "NO...! I-I'm just gonna go wait outside!!" with vpunch
    p scream "别……！我、我去外面等你好了！！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:2038
translate zh ch4_83c29565:

    # w innocent "Hmhm, don't be too hard on yourself~ I promise you made a better impression than you think."
    w innocent "嘿嘿，别对自己太严格~我保证你给她留下的印象比你想的要好。"

# game/script.rpy:2042
translate zh ch4_2175cd9e:

    # "Pastille walks out of the apothecary, and I lean against the counter, waiting for Astragalus to re-emerge from the back room."
    "帕斯提尔走出了药房。我靠在柜台边，等着艾丝特格拉斯从后屋里出来。"

# game/script.rpy:2043
translate zh ch4_e0cb17ac:

    # "But when she does, it's with a bag full of... well... I'm not quite sure."
    "但当她回来的时候，她手里提着一袋子……呃……我不确定是什么东西。"

# game/script.rpy:2044
translate zh ch4_76b2fe88_9:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:2047
translate zh ch4_e90d8861:

    # a "...Hm? Where'd your boyfriend go?"
    a "……欸？你男朋友呢？"

# game/script.rpy:2048
translate zh ch4_abadde12:

    # w date "You shouldn't call him that. Might I ask--what is it you're holding?"
    w date "你不该这么称呼他。恕我冒昧——你手里拿的是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:2049
translate zh ch4_4abab777:

    # a happy "Busted lamp. I've been meaning to glue it back together myself, until I saw the opportunity to save myself the trouble."
    a happy "摔碎的灯。我一直想自己把它粘回去，但现在给自己省个麻烦的机会就在眼前。"

# game/script.rpy:2050
translate zh ch4_62e9d646:

    # w pout "How offensive. Take it to a repair shop, like everyone else."
    w pout "真过分。你该去维修店，别人都是那么做的。"

# game/script.rpy:2051
translate zh ch4_d29f2200:

    # a lol "Nah, waste of money. You better keep that boy around--he's useful."
    a lol "别呀，那是浪费钱。你最好把那个男生留在身边——他很有用。"

# game/script.rpy:2052
translate zh ch4_88d15fb4:

    # w calm "You've certainly changed your tune...."
    w calm "你的态度转变得真彻底……"

# game/script.rpy:2053
translate zh ch4_d330e65c:

    # a happy "He's cute. I get a good vibe from him."
    a happy "他挺可爱，给我的感觉挺不错。"

# game/script.rpy:2054
translate zh ch4_f8e67399:

    # a lol2 "Anyway, bring him back in sometime so I can get this lamp fixed. Got it?"
    a lol2 "总之，下次把他带过来修我的灯，知道了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2055
translate zh ch4_743dec44:

    # w happy "He won't be doing that!!"
    w happy "想都别想！！"

# game/script.rpy:2056
translate zh ch4_91bd044b:

    # a neutral "Seriously, though. Where I'm from, we were taught that you can tell a lot about a witch from their magic..."
    a neutral "不过说正经的。在我们那里，我们接受的教育是：从一个巫师的魔法中，你能看出来关于ta本人的方方面面……"

# game/script.rpy:2057
translate zh ch4_f2f55ac5:

    # a closed "And his? Very empathetic. Sincere, compassionate."
    a closed "那么他的魔法呢？极具同理心。真诚、具有同情心。"

# game/script.rpy:2058
translate zh ch4_7019ca7c:

    # w love "Well, you aren't wrong, but... how can you judge that sort of thing after witnessing one little spell?"
    w love "唔，倒是没说错，不过……你怎么能从一个小法术里就断定出这些东西？"

# game/script.rpy:2059
translate zh ch4_bd2d025d:

    # a lol "Ha, wouldn't YOU like to know?"
    a lol "哈，很想知道原理吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2060
translate zh ch4_768d16f3:

    # w calm "Hmhm, I don't need your superstitions. I have a date to get back to."
    w calm "哼哼，我没你那么迷信。我要继续约会了。"

# game/script.rpy:2061
translate zh ch4_dfa92959:

    # a smile "Heh, alright. Have fun, Periwinkle...."
    a smile "哈，好吧。玩得开心，佩兰温可……"

# game/script.rpy:2062
translate zh ch4_c2b45ec4:

    # w innocent "Oh, I very much intend to 💙"
    w innocent "噢，我非常希望能如此💙"

# game/script.rpy:2066
translate zh ch4_7cd4194b:

    # n "Smiling to himself, Periwinkle strides confidently out the door to where Pastille is waiting."
    n "佩兰温可露出开心的微笑。他大步流星地出了门，走到帕斯提尔等待的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:2074
translate zh ch4_d3b6758e:

    # p "Hey--um... do I still need to pay for that bottle?"
    p "嘿——呃……我还得赔那个瓶子吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2075
translate zh ch4_c189c5fa:

    # w date calm "She didn't mention it."
    w date calm "她没这么说。"

# game/script.rpy:2076
translate zh ch4_3e5dc9da:

    # p calm "Phew. I'm glad I could fix it... I was worried it might be expensive."
    p calm "呼。还好我能修……我还在担心它会不会很贵。"

# game/script.rpy:2077
translate zh ch4_b7aae312:

    # w smile "You never told me you were so good with magic. As I recall, you said you had been living without it?"
    w smile "你从没跟我说过你魔法这么厉害。我记得你说你从小到大一直没有用过魔法？"

# game/script.rpy:2078
translate zh ch4_ae7d5ce2:

    # p think "Yeah, mostly."
    p think "是啊，大部分时间是的。"

# game/script.rpy:2079
translate zh ch4_d4e69b9f:

    # p ehe "I won't get into the reasons why... but I got back into studying it recently."
    p ehe "原因就不细说了……不过我最近在重拾魔法的学习了。"

# game/script.rpy:2080
translate zh ch4_b20c986a:

    # w happy "Astragalus certainly thought you were talented. I'm impressed too, of course."
    w happy "很明显，艾丝特格拉斯觉得你很有天分。当然，我也被惊艳到了。"

# game/script.rpy:2081
translate zh ch4_537846ba:

    # p shy "Th-thanks... haha, if only I could use magic to stop myself from being a klutz...."
    p shy "谢、谢谢……哈哈，要是魔法能让我别那么像笨木头就好了……"

# game/script.rpy:2082
translate zh ch4_e7496cc5:

    # w teehee "Oh, are you embracing that nickname now?"
    w teehee "喔，你现在接受这个昵称了？"

# game/script.rpy:2083
translate zh ch4_32e4b18b:

    # p scream "N-no!! Please go back to saying \"my sweet\"!!!" with vpunch
    p scream "没、没有！！请还是叫我“我的甜心”！！！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:2084
translate zh ch4_e86c0674:

    # w love "Ah~ if you like that one so much, I suppose I have no choice! 💙"
    w love "啊~既然你那么喜欢这个昵称，那我就别无选择啦！💙"

# game/script.rpy:2085
translate zh ch4_419d487f:

    # p omgstop "I-I... I just meant...!"
    p omgstop "我、我……我的意思是……！"

# game/script.rpy:2086
translate zh ch4_8c34b708:

    # p flustered "N-Nevermind!! Don't call me anything...!" with vpunch
    p flustered "算、算了！！什么都别叫我……！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:2087
translate zh ch4_58252808:

    # w shy "Hmhmhm 💙 Oh, Pastille...."
    w shy "哼哼哼💙噢，帕斯提尔……"

# game/script.rpy:2090
translate zh ch4_5df76680:

    # "We resume our stroll around town..."
    "我们继续在小镇里溜达……"

# game/script.rpy:2091
translate zh ch4_df4e55af:

    # "This time, it's Pastille who takes the lead. He seems to have someplace in mind, but hasn't said as much."
    "这次是帕斯提尔在带路。看上去他心中有个目的地，但他没明说。"

# game/script.rpy:2092
translate zh ch4_5623091f:

    # "He merely takes my hand and leads me up a labyrinth of stairs..."
    "他只是牵着我的手，带我走上错综复杂的阶梯……"

# game/script.rpy:2093
translate zh ch4_76b2fe88_10:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:2097
translate zh ch4_fd97df8a:

    # "And once we reach the top..."
    "当我们来到最高处时……"

# game/script.rpy:2098
translate zh ch4_37819467:

    # "A gust of wind swoops through the trees overhead, showering us in flower petals."
    "一阵强风席卷了我们头顶的大树，花瓣纷纷扬扬。"

# game/script.rpy:2099
translate zh ch4_af3d310d:

    # nvl clear
    # w date ah "Ah. Peach blossoms..."
    nvl clear
    w date ah "啊。是桃花……"

# game/script.rpy:2103
translate zh ch4_bf824512:

    # p "It's nice, isn't it?"
    p "很不错吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2104
translate zh ch4_745730c3:

    # w love "Hmhm, I can't help but think you're trying to tell me something right now~"
    w love "哼哼，我不禁觉得你是在试图给我传达点什么~"

# game/script.rpy:2105
translate zh ch4_36d2e96b:

    # p oh "Huh...?"
    p oh "哈……？"

# game/script.rpy:2106
translate zh ch4_7daf2c79:

    # w smile "Don't you remember? My \"aphrodisiac\" was also peach-scented..."
    w smile "你忘了吗？我的“催情剂”是桃子味的……"

# game/script.rpy:2107
translate zh ch4_290ca16a:

    # p wha "Ah..."
    p wha "啊……"

# game/script.rpy:2108
translate zh ch4_d493bae3:

    # p kyaa "A-AH...! I WASN'T THINKING ABOUT THAT...!!!" with vpunch
    p kyaa "啊、啊……！我没在想那种事……！！！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:2109
translate zh ch4_d739c596:

    # p wow "I-I just, was trying to think of other places we could go, and this one came to mind..."
    p wow "我、我只是在想我们还能去哪，然后就想到这里了……"

# game/script.rpy:2110
translate zh ch4_eab2cf4c:

    # w happy "It's lovely. Very romantic 💙"
    w happy "特别好。很浪漫💙"

# game/script.rpy:2111
translate zh ch4_2f1a8383:

    # w shy "(Straight out of a shoujo manga, honestly... how does he know I'm weak to such things?)"
    w shy "（老实说，这就像是少女漫画照进现实……他怎么知道我对这类事物毫无抵抗力的？）"

# game/script.rpy:2112
translate zh ch4_9218331e:

    # p omg "We don't have to stay... I mean, we've already walked around so much--it's okay if you wanna head back now..."
    p omg "我们不是非要呆在这里……我是说，我们已经逛了这么久了——如果你现在想回去也没问题……"

# game/script.rpy:2113
translate zh ch4_18984878:

    # p omgstop "N-NOT TO... DO THINGS... I just meant...! I-I'm gonna stop talking......" with vpunch
    p omgstop "不、不是为了……做什么……我的意思是……！我、我闭嘴算了……" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:2114
translate zh ch4_6d760657:

    # w love "Pastille."
    w love "帕斯提尔。"

# game/script.rpy:2115
translate zh ch4_7a8b97fb:

    # p seriously "Y-yes...?"
    p seriously "你、你说……？"

# game/script.rpy:2116
translate zh ch4_ec1d1b34:

    # w calm "You've presented me quite the conundrum. If I kiss you now, you'll definitely want to return home with me as soon as possible..."
    w calm "你给我出了个难题。如果我现在吻你，你肯定会想尽快和我一起回家……"

# game/script.rpy:2117
translate zh ch4_80145f9c:

    # w happy "But I wasn't done learning all about you. I'm not ready for our date to end 💙"
    w happy "但我对你的了解还不够呢。我不想我们的约会那么快就结束💙"

# game/script.rpy:2118
translate zh ch4_5974e4ff:

    # p embarrassed "O-oh... that IS a conundrum...."
    p embarrassed "喔、喔……那确实是难题……"

# game/script.rpy:2119
translate zh ch4_dbc74acd:

    # w love "Yes, you see? Both options are equally appealing. However can I decide~?"
    w love "对吧对吧？两个选项都一样有诱惑力。我要怎么选择呢~？"

# game/script.rpy:2120
translate zh ch4_ec2c6956:

    # p shy "Haha, um, well... i-it's still light out! Maybe we can hold back until after dinner...."
    p shy "哈哈，呃，这个……现、现在天还亮着呢！也许我们可以等到晚餐后再……"

# game/script.rpy:2121
translate zh ch4_584de9f1:

    # w teehee "Or I could have YOU for dinner 💙"
    w teehee "或者由你来当我的晚餐💙"

# game/script.rpy:2122
translate zh ch4_31907a91:

    # p kyaa "A-AH...!" with vpunch
    p kyaa "啊、啊……！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:2123
translate zh ch4_f4a3afbc:

    # w calm "On the other hand, you bring up a valid point. Holding back is fun in itself."
    w calm "另外，你提到了一个很有道理的点。等待本身就很有趣。"

# game/script.rpy:2124
translate zh ch4_9d41c26b:

    # p omgstop "Do you expect me to recover after what you just said...?!"
    p omgstop "你刚才说那种话要我怎么恢复冷静……？！"

# game/script.rpy:2125
translate zh ch4_32adccf0:

    # w happy "See~? This IS quite fun!"
    w happy "看吧~？确实有趣！"

# game/script.rpy:2126
translate zh ch4_b5263d43:

    # w calm "It's decided, then. The date continues."
    w calm "那就这么决定了。约会继续。"

# game/script.rpy:2130
translate zh ch4_98062818:

    # "I give Pastille a moment to calm himself."
    "我给帕斯提尔时间让他冷静下来。"

# game/script.rpy:2131
translate zh ch4_43346300:

    # "We walk up to the railing and look out at the town..."
    "我们走到栏杆边，俯瞰着这座小镇……"

# game/script.rpy:2132
translate zh ch4_2e739e18:

    # nvl clear
    # "You can see Atelier Sweets from here. And the train station next to it."
    nvl clear
    "从这里能看到糖果工坊，还有旁边的火车站。"

# game/script.rpy:2134
translate zh ch4_65c0b220:

    # "My house is... somewhere in a row of similarly built homes. Inconspicuous."
    "我的房子坐落在……一排长得都差不多的住宅中间。并不起眼。"

# game/script.rpy:2135
translate zh ch4_140deac1:

    # "Fallen petals litter the bricks at our feet, with every little breeze carrying a few more over the railing to land somewhere unknown."
    "我们脚踩的砖头上落英堆积。每一阵微风都会卷走更多的花瓣越过栏杆，落向未知的某处。"

# game/script.rpy:2136
translate zh ch4_9b3a7e5d:

    # "After watching them for a while, I turn back to Pastille."
    "观赏了一会儿后，我再次转向帕斯提尔。"

# game/script.rpy:2137
translate zh ch4_76b2fe88_11:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:2140
translate zh ch4_6319f667:

    # w date "Tell me about your magic."
    w date "跟我讲讲你的魔法。"

# game/script.rpy:2141
translate zh ch4_81ee26b5:

    # p um "O-okay... what do you want to know?"
    p um "好、好的……你想了解哪方面？"

# game/script.rpy:2142
translate zh ch4_c829cbee:

    # w innocent "Your specialty, dear!"
    w innocent "当然是你的招牌魔法了，亲爱的！"

# game/script.rpy:2143
translate zh ch4_9847abef:

    # w smile "If you were that good at reconstruction, I imagine it must fall somewhere in that category...?"
    w smile "既然你那么擅长修理复原，那你的招牌肯定是往这个方向走吧……？"

# game/script.rpy:2144
translate zh ch4_b09961bf:

    # p ehe "Um, not really... I'm actually an astral witch."
    p ehe "呃，不是……我其实是个精神系巫师。"

# game/script.rpy:2145
translate zh ch4_443121bc:

    # w my "My, how rare! And what exactly does that entail for you?"
    w my "哇，好少见！那对你来说意味着什么呢？"

# game/script.rpy:2146
translate zh ch4_44c2df3e:

    # p shy "Ahh, well, I mostly use it for fire spells, like anyone else..."
    p shy "啊——呃，我大多时候都用来施展火系法术，就和其他巫师一样……"

# game/script.rpy:2147
translate zh ch4_bcabe313:

    # w oh "Forgive me, I'm not well-versed in magic theory... but doesn't astral magic have something to do with creation?"
    w oh "原谅我这么问，我对魔法理论不是很精通……但精神系魔法不是应该和创造有关系吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2148
translate zh ch4_ac2d501e:

    # p ehe2 "It does... but that stuff is pretty advanced. I haven't been able to find any books explaining how to use it."
    p ehe2 "是有关系……但那就比较超前了。我还没找到任何写了怎么使用精神系魔法的书。"

# game/script.rpy:2149
translate zh ch4_02f8bfe1:

    # p embarrassed "...Which is probably for the best, actually. No one should be allowed to go around creating souls spontaneously...!"
    p embarrassed "……但可能那样才是最好的吧。怎么能随心所欲地到处创造灵魂呢……！"

# game/script.rpy:2150
translate zh ch4_29508975:

    # w neutral "Hm..."
    w neutral "唔……"

# game/script.rpy:2152
translate zh ch4_1b5322bf:

    # "Pastille rubs the back of his neck, looking off into the distance."
    "帕斯提尔搓着后颈，移开目光望向远处。"

# game/script.rpy:2153
translate zh ch4_309805fa:

    # "He seems so troubled by the subject..."
    "他似乎被这个话题深深困扰……"

# game/script.rpy:2154
translate zh ch4_9604342e:

    # "I suppose because he had been living without magic, it may feel strange to openly discuss it?"
    "我猜是因为他之前一直不用魔法，所以要开诚布公地谈这件事可能会让他感觉怪怪的？"

# game/script.rpy:2155
translate zh ch4_48123bf8:

    # nvl clear
    # "An astral witch, though... I wouldn't have guessed."
    nvl clear
    "不过，精神系巫师啊……真是想不到。"

# game/script.rpy:2157
translate zh ch4_c8d56a68:

    # "Putting two and two together, ONE thing makes perfect sense now..."
    "把几件事联系在一起后，一个事实便呼之欲出……"

# game/script.rpy:2158
translate zh ch4_551942a5:

    # nvl clear
    # w ah "So the famous Atelier Sweets golem was YOUR creation?"
    nvl clear
    w ah "所以糖果工坊那个很火的魔像是你创造出来的？"

# game/script.rpy:2161
translate zh ch4_2c8fd31f:

    # p ehe2 "Haha, is she really that famous? I'd expect our sales to be a little better if that were the case..."
    p ehe2 "哈哈，她真有那么火吗？要真是这样，我们的营业额应该更好看一点才对……"

# game/script.rpy:2162
translate zh ch4_fd97e90a:

    # p flustered2 "But... yeah. Just don't go around telling everyone--I didn't know what I was doing when I made her."
    p flustered2 "不过……没错。拜托不要说出去——我制造她的时候根本没考虑清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:2163
translate zh ch4_e7fb158c:

    # w my "What an amazing feat... and yet you sound almost ashamed of it!"
    w my "多么惊人的壮举……结果你听起来甚至好像以此为耻一样！"

# game/script.rpy:2164
translate zh ch4_0bf92251:

    # p ohno "I-it's not like I regret it or anything... Gumdrop is really great! I just..."
    p ohno "倒、倒不是说我后悔了什么的……甘姆卓真的很好！我只是……"

# game/script.rpy:2165
translate zh ch4_2ed99bc8:

    # p nervous "I feel bad that she's stuck in a body with so many limitations. Like, she didn't ask to be made that way..."
    p nervous "我很内疚，因为她被困在了一具有很多限制的身体里。就，又不是她自己想被做成那样的……"

# game/script.rpy:2166
translate zh ch4_8694e630:

    # p flustered2 "I didn't know you could even make golems that felt real emotions, so of course I never considered any of that."
    p flustered2 "我都不知道竟然真能做出具备情感的魔像，所以当然我从没仔细想过那些。"

# game/script.rpy:2167
translate zh ch4_cde66f06:

    # p shy "...Sorry to go off about it. I-I've just been feeling guilty lately--kind of a heavy topic."
    p shy "……抱歉突然扯这些。我、我只是最近感觉很愧疚——这话题有点儿沉重。"

# game/script.rpy:2168
translate zh ch4_9931704c:

    # w ah "No, no... thank you for telling me."
    w ah "不，不……谢谢你告诉我这些。"

# game/script.rpy:2169
translate zh ch4_b7df5332:

    # w calm "It's as if I've discovered a whole new side of you today. I'm grateful to know it."
    w calm "我感觉今天像是发掘出了你全新的另一面。能知道这件事我很感激。"

# game/script.rpy:2170
translate zh ch4_d2da19ee:

    # p ehe "Thanks for listening... I don't get many chances to talk about things like this, so I'm grateful for it, too."
    p ehe "谢谢你听我说……我一般不怎么有机会谈这些，所以我也很感激。"

# game/script.rpy:2171
translate zh ch4_2f822c09:

    # w love "Hmhm, hearing you speak of her though, I'd love to meet this golem of yours one day."
    w love "哼哼，不过听你这么一说，我好想和你的魔像见上一面。"

# game/script.rpy:2172
translate zh ch4_87960f32:

    # p sure "Sure. Maybe one day."
    p sure "当然了。某天吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2175
translate zh ch4_e955de1d:

    # "Pastille is amazing."
    "帕斯提尔实在神奇。"

# game/script.rpy:2176
translate zh ch4_dd1b4e98:

    # "I've never met anyone who would downplay their talents this much--I could ask a thousand questions and still only scratch the surface..."
    "我还从没见过对自己的天赋这么轻描淡写的人。对他即使问上一千个问题，我也只能了解到冰山一角……"

# game/script.rpy:2177
translate zh ch4_034046bb:

    # "My, now I'M the insatiable one. How the tables have turned!"
    "天，我现在成了那个欲求不满的人了。天道好轮回！"

# game/script.rpy:2178
translate zh ch4_aa528040:

    # nvl clear
    # "We decide it's time to move on, and descend the stairs from whence we came..."
    nvl clear
    "我们决定继续前进，于是走下来时的台阶……"

# game/script.rpy:2180
translate zh ch4_5310cd5c:

    # "...Still chatting endlessly as we decide where we'll wander to next."
    "……在想接下来要去哪里时还在没完没了地畅谈。"

# game/script.rpy:2181
translate zh ch4_76b2fe88_12:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:2184
translate zh ch4_ab4f864b:

    # "Over dinner, Pastille opens up a little more."
    "用晚餐的时候，帕斯提尔放得更开一点了。"

# game/script.rpy:2185
translate zh ch4_2a1a4890:

    # "We trade anecdotes, listening intently to each others' stories no matter how unremarkable the events told within them."
    "我们交换着趣闻轶事，无论故事里的事件听上去有多稀松平常，我俩都会听得无比认真。"

# game/script.rpy:2186
translate zh ch4_a504ab29:

    # "I could never tire of it~ I was hooked by his every word."
    "我永远不会感到厌倦~他说出的每个字都令我神魂颠倒。"

# game/script.rpy:2187
translate zh ch4_efbe6e4c:

    # nvl clear
    # "Alas, the hours flew by, and our day together was quickly approaching its end..."
    nvl clear
    "唉，时间飞逝，我们的约会很快就要结束了……"

# game/script.rpy:2189
translate zh ch4_d04a4349:

    # "But now we had the whole night to look forward to 💙"
    "不过我们还有大好的夜晚时光在前方等待💙"

# game/script.rpy:2190
translate zh ch4_b7200d05:

    # "The sun was on its way down as we emerged back onto the street, the atmosphere so different than it had been just a short while ago."
    "当我们回到街上时，太阳已在西沉，气氛一下子变得很不一样。"

# game/script.rpy:2191
